  <item>
    <title>vol 008 奢侈品行业探秘！从路易十四到法国teenager</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6773d80715a5fd520e0cca66</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6773d80715a5fd520e0cca66</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 31 Dec 2024 11:52:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>奢侈品为啥那么贵？ 在奢侈品行业工作体验如何？法国人是什么时候开始做奢侈品的？本期我们将与Joey一起探秘让无数人痴狂的奢侈品行业！Joey还会和我们分享她在中国以及法国的工作经历，希望你听后可以对奢侈品有新的了解。</span></p><span></span><p><span>「业余分子」，希望用有趣的故事、经历和思考，探寻社会时钟外的无限可能，试图记录生活中有意义的时刻！</span></p><span></span><p><span>认识朋友，见识世界。</span></p><span></span><p><span>由非盈利组织微距教育出品。建议你边听边遛弯儿。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>本期主播：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>张小兵：伦敦常住民，聊天爱好者。</span></p><span></span><p><span>傅师傅：怀揣学术理想的咨询打工人。业余练习传统武术。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>本期嘉宾：</span></h2><span></span><p><span>小猴子Joey： 巴黎生活偶然打开时尚界大门便开始疯狂学习。励志未来从事让女性变美变自信的事业。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>本期您将听到：</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">00:01:50</a> 路易十四原来挖了意大利的墙角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">00:04:40</a> 温州华人占领佛罗伦萨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">00:09:50</a> 初入奢侈品行业，收获神仙实习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">00:13:15</a> 拍摄小花的第一现场！项目经理竟是00后</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1294">00:21:34</a> 奢侈品公司也爱买买买</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1897">00:31:37</a> 法国补贴是万能饭卡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2174">00:36:14</a> 法国职场的倒反天罡：乙方催甲方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">00:40:30</a> 一些广告行业黑话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2650">00:44:10</a> 奢侈品的本质是造梦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3037">00:50:37</a> 年轻人开始买奢侈品了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3175">00:52:55</a> 全世界的二手奢侈品都在上海</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3518">00:58:38</a> 奢侈品是如何人为创造阶级感的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3898">00:64:58</a> 路易十四是第一代广告人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4037">00:67:17</a> 祛魅奢侈品之后开始看书📖</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>不定期更新，欢迎大家继续关注。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>后期：乐乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>内容：Joey，张小兵</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>封面：ChrisTaopher</span></strong></p>]]></description>
